WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
[Silent recording] ChatGPT prepares a greeting and a Markdown joke challenge for the coding agent.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
The coding agent checks its Hauddy inbox. The received message includes marc-test-joke.md.

00:13.000 --> 00:20.000
